---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SignalPost from '../components/SignalPost.astro';
import '../styles/observatory.css';
import '../styles/workbench.css';
const folders = [
 {n:'01',title:'The starting point',tag:'Our story',kind:'story',href:'#story',note:'WHY DOES IT HAVE TO BE THIS HARD?'},
 {n:'02',title:'Product 0001',tag:'Coming soon',kind:'product',href:'#product',note:'0001'},
 {n:'03',title:'Field notes',tag:'Coming soon',kind:'notes',note:'QUESTIONS WORTH KEEPING'},
 {n:'04',title:'The people',tag:'Chidi + Michael',kind:'humans',href:'#people',note:'TWO MINDS. ONE WORKBENCH.'},
 {n:'05',title:'Experiments',tag:'Coming soon',kind:'experiments',note:'WHAT IF…'},
 {n:'06',title:'Signal Mail',tag:'Send your idea',kind:'mail',href:'#signal',note:'DEAR BOOMLEY,'}
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Boomley — A workbench for better everyday things.">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<div class="film-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="dust-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<header class="bench-header" id="top"><a class="boomer-logo" href="#top" aria-label="Boomer — Boomley home">boomer<span aria-hidden="true"></span></a><nav aria-label="Primary"><a href="#archive">Workbench</a><a href="#people">The people</a><a href="#signal">Signal Mail</a></nav><a class="contact-pill" href="mailto:hello@boomley.com">Say hello</a></header>
<div class="bench-layout">
<aside class="bench-sidebar"><span class="index-label">BOOMLEY / OPEN WORKBENCH</span><p>Everyday life has enough friction.<br/>We’re here to question it.</p><p>We’re Chidi and Michael. We notice the things people work around, ask what could be better, and build thoughtful digital products.</p><a class="sidebar-cta" href="#signal">Have something in mind? Write to us ↗</a><div class="sidebar-tags"><span>Product</span><span>Research</span><span>Engineering</span><span>People</span></div><button class="motion-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Ⅱ Pause motion</button><div class="sidebar-bottom"><span>Small team. Open minds.</span><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></div></aside>
<main id="main">
<section class="archive" id="archive"><div class="archive-intro"><span class="archive-tab">A few things worth opening</span><h1>Less friction.<br/><span>More possibility.</span></h1><p>Ideas, people, and work in progress.<br/>Follow the thread. Open a folder. Add your own question.</p></div>
<div class="folder-grid"><svg class="journey-path" viewBox="0 0 900 600" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M150 150H750Q885 150 885 300T750 450H150"/><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="5"/><circle cx="450" cy="150" r="5"/><circle cx="750" cy="150" r="5"/><circle cx="150" cy="450" r="5"/><circle cx="450" cy="450" r="5"/><circle cx="750" cy="450" r="5"/></svg>
{folders.map(f=><article class:list={['archive-folder',f.kind]}><a class="folder-link" href={f.href || '#soon-'+f.kind}><div class="folder-object" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sheet sheet-back"></div><div class="sheet sheet-middle"></div><div class="sheet sheet-face"><span class="sheet-top">BOOMLEY / {f.n}</span>{f.kind==='humans'? <div class="mini-portraits"><img src="/media/founders/chidi.webp" alt="" width="1000" height="1000"/><img src="/media/founders/michael.webp" alt="" width="1000" height="1000"/></div>:<strong>{f.note}</strong>}<span class="sheet-foot">{f.tag}</span></div><span class="folder-number">{f.n}</span></div><h2>{f.title}</h2><p>{f.tag}</p></a>{!f.href&&<div class="soon-note" id={'soon-'+f.kind}><p>Coming soon</p><a href="#signal">Have a question to contribute?</a></div>}</article>)}
</div><div class="archive-foot"><span>01 — 06 / THE JOURNEY SO FAR</span><span>Always a work in progress.</span></div></section>
<section id="story" class="bench-story"><span class="index-label">01 / THE STARTING POINT</span><h2>You shouldn’t need<br/>a workaround for <em>everything.</em></h2><div class="story-columns"><p>Another extra step. Another tool to manage. Another small frustration you’ve learned to live with. We think those everyday problems deserve a closer look.</p><p>Better tools should give something back: a little time, a clearer head, an easier day. That’s the possibility we’re working towards—one useful thing at a time.</p></div><a class="ink-link" href="#signal">What would you make easier?</a></section>
<section id="product" class="product-note"><div><span class="index-label">02 / PRIVATE BUILD</span><h2>0001<span>Coming soon</span></h2><p>Our first product is in development. The details stay under wraps for now. Leave your email and we’ll share when there’s something ready to show.</p></div><form class="waitlist" name="product-0001" method="POST" action="/thank-you" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" data-waitlist><input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="product-0001"/><p class="honeypot"><label>Leave empty<input name="bot-field"/></label></p><label for="wait-email">A note when it’s ready.</label><div class="email-row"><input id="wait-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="Your email address"/><button type="submit">Keep me posted</button></div><p class="form-note">Product updates only. Unsubscribe anytime.</p><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section>
    <section id="people" class="section wrap people"><div class="section-top micro"><span>04 / THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE QUESTIONS</span><span>TWO DISCIPLINES. ONE CONVERSATION.</span></div><div class="people-intro"><h2>Small team.<br/><em>Open minds.</em></h2><p>No layers of introductions.<br/>Just the two of us, figuring things out<br/>and making things happen.</p></div><div class="people-grid"><article class="person"><div class="portrait"><img src="/media/founders/chidi.webp" alt="Chidi, co-founder of Boomley" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"/><span class="portrait-tab micro">THE QUESTION / WHY?</span></div><div class="person-name"><h3>Chidi</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><span class="micro">PRODUCT & STRATEGY</span><p>Research, product thinking, and the experience of the person using it.</p></article><article class="person person-michael"><div class="portrait"><img src="/media/founders/michael.webp" alt="Michael, co-founder of Boomley" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"/><span class="portrait-tab micro">THE QUESTION / HOW?</span></div><div class="person-name"><h3>Michael</h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><span class="micro">SOFTWARE ENGINEERING</span><p>Systems, architecture, and turning a good question into something real.</p></article></div></section>

<SignalPost/>
<footer class="bench-footer"><a class="boomer-logo" href="#top" aria-label="Back to top">boomer<span aria-hidden="true"></span></a><p>A good question can start something.</p><a href="mailto:hello@boomley.com">hello@boomley.com</a><div><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} BOOMLEY</span><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="#archive">Back to the folders ↑</a></div></footer>
</main></div><script>import '../scripts/observatory.ts';</script>
</BaseLayout>
